# Local scratch mods. `npm create osfui@latest` generates the starters that
# used to be committed here. Anchored and directory-scoped on purpose: a bare
# `examples` also swallows any nested examples/ directory, which is how a
# deleted-but-still-on-disk file can leave `git status` clean while CI fails.
/examples/
